    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, when you say \"the dominant consensus\" and \"outdated,\" it sounds like you're saying there's basically no good argument left for cars or highway funding at all. if i'm writing this for a municipal board, shouldn't i be presenting this as a Choice A vs Choice B situation rather than just saying one is essentially a failed policy? it feels like you're leaning pretty hard into the transit side here.",
